<title>INDIA: India Reliance sees sales at 200 bln rps by 2000.</title>
<headline>India Reliance sees sales at 200 bln rps by 2000.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Reliance Industries expects its sales to touch 200 billion rupees by 2000, its chairman said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>&quot;Based on firm plans, our sales are expected to approach the 20,000 crore rupees (200 billion rupees) milestone by the year 2000,&quot; chairman Dhirubhai Ambani told the annual general meeting of shareholders on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
